{
    "openapi": "3.1.0",
    "info": {
        "title": "contentmaschine.ai API",
        "version": "1.0.0",
        "description": "External REST API for contentmaschine.ai.\n\n## Authentication\nAll `/v1/*` endpoints require an API key sent as a Bearer token:\n```\nAuthorization: Bearer sk-cm-<your-key>\n```\nManage your API key in the Dashboard \u2192 API tab.\n\n## Scopes\nEach operation names the scope it needs in `x-required-scope`. There are five\ncontainers (`images`, `videos`, `audio`, `text`, `files`), each with `read` and `write`.\n**A write scope always includes the read scope of the same container**: a token\nwith `images:write` can also call everything that needs `images:read`. The rule does\nnot cross containers, so `images:write` does not grant `text:read`.\n\n## Async pattern\nImage generation and upscaling are asynchronous.\n1. Submit a job - receive a `job_id` (or `krea_job_id` for upscale).\n2. Poll the status endpoint until `status` is `completed` or `failed`.\n3. Download the result using the returned `download_url`.\n\n## Downloading files\nThere are TWO download paths and they do NOT authorize the same way.\n\n- `GET /v1/files/{uuid}/download` requires `files:read` **plus** the read\n  scope of the container the file belongs to (an image needs `images:read`,\n  a video `videos:read`, and so on). A token holding `files:read` alone gets\n  a 404 for a file it may not read - deliberately a 404, not a 403, so a\n  denial is indistinguishable from a nonexistent file.\n- `GET /api/files/download/{uuid}` is the older path. It is still reachable\n  with the same Bearer token and it is owner-checked. For an `sk-cm-` API key\n  it carries **no scope check at all** - any valid key belonging to the owner\n  is served the file. An OAuth access token needs the read scope of the\n  file's container, as on the v1 route, and gets a 404 without it.\n  It is documented because real callers use it. Prefer the `/v1/` route.\n\nBoth return a 302 to a presigned URL valid for one hour when the file lives\nin object storage. That redirect target is a CREDENTIAL: anyone holding it\ncan read the object until it expires. Do not log it or pass it on.\n\n## Errors\nEvery error uses ONE envelope (see the `ErrorEnvelope` schema and the\n`default` response on every operation):\n```json\n{\"success\":false,\"error\":{\"message\":\"...\",\"code\":404,\"type\":\"not_found\",\n \"correlation_id\":\"0f3a...c1\"},\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-01T12:00:00+00:00\"}\n```\nBranch on `error.type`, never on `error.message` - the sentence may be\nreworded at any time. `error.code` is always the integer HTTP status.\n`error.correlation_id` is the handle to quote to support: it appears in both\nthe response and the server log line for the same request.\n\n## Breaking changes\nThree changes have already shipped on this surface. See the machine-readable\n`x-breaking-changes` block at the root of this document for the full detail.\n\n1. **Gallery item identity moved from the generation uuid to the FILE uuid.**\n   `GalleryItem.uuid` is now the uuid of the file, which is what\n   `/api/files/download/{uuid}` and the v1 file routes take. The generation\n   uuid is still returned, under the new `generation_uuid` field.\n2. **The `category` vocabulary moved from singular to plural container names**\n   (`image` -> `images`, `video` -> `videos`). Every payload now reports the\n   plural, matching the scope vocabulary. The singular forms are still\n   ACCEPTED on the `?category=` filter for one more release and answer with a\n   `Deprecation: true` header; they will be removed.\n3. **`error.code` is now always the integer HTTP status.** The three token\n   failure identifiers (`token_expired`, `token_revoked`, `token_invalid`)\n   used to be put in `error.code` as strings; they are byte-identical but now\n   live in the new, always-present `error.type`. If you branch on\n   `error.code === \"token_revoked\"`, rename the key.",
        "contact": {
            "url": "https://contentmaschine.ai"
        }
    },
    "servers": [
        {
            "url": "https://contentmaschine.ai/api",
            "description": "Production"
        }
    ],
    "security": [
        {
            "BearerAuth": []
        },
        {
            "OAuth2": []
        }
    ],
    "components": {
        "securitySchemes": {
            "BearerAuth": {
                "type": "http",
                "scheme": "bearer",
                "bearerFormat": "API Key (sk-cm-...) or OAuth access token"
            },
            "OAuth2": {
                "type": "oauth2",
                "flows": {
                    "authorizationCode": {
                        "authorizationUrl": "https://contentmaschine.ai/api/oauth/authorize",
                        "tokenUrl": "https://contentmaschine.ai/api/oauth/token",
                        "refreshUrl": "https://contentmaschine.ai/api/oauth/token",
                        "scopes": {
                            "images:read": "Read images",
                            "images:write": "Create and edit images (includes read)",
                            "videos:read": "Read videos",
                            "videos:write": "Create and edit videos (includes read)",
                            "audio:read": "Read audio",
                            "audio:write": "Create and edit audio (includes read)",
                            "text:read": "Read text",
                            "text:write": "Create and edit text (includes read)",
                            "files:read": "Read files",
                            "files:write": "Create and edit files (includes read)"
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "schemas": {
            "ErrorEnvelope": {
                "type": "object",
                "description": "The single error envelope. `error.code` is ALWAYS the integer HTTP status; `error.type` is the stable machine-readable identifier a client branches on; `error.message` is a human sentence that may be reworded without notice; `error.correlation_id` is an opaque 16-hex handle that also appears in the server log line for the same request - quote it to support. Some errors add further keys (a 403 from the scope gate adds `required_scope` and `held_scopes`, a 402 `insufficient_credits` adds `required_credits` and `available_credits` when known); the four keys above are always present.",
                "required": [
                    "success",
                    "error",
                    "timestamp"
                ],
                "properties": {
                    "success": {
                        "type": "boolean",
                        "example": false
                    },
                    "error": {
                        "type": "object",
                        "required": [
                            "message",
                            "code",
                            "type",
                            "correlation_id"
                        ],
                        "properties": {
                            "message": {
                                "type": "string",
                                "description": "Human-readable. Do NOT branch on this."
                            },
                            "code": {
                                "type": "integer",
                                "description": "The HTTP status, as an integer. Always.",
                                "example": 404
                            },
                            "type": {
                                "type": "string",
                                "description": "Stable identifier. Branch on this. An unmapped 4xx is `client_error`, an unmapped 5xx is `server_error`.",
                                "example": "not_found",
                                "enum": [
                                    "bad_request",
                                    "unauthorized",
                                    "insufficient_credits",
                                    "forbidden",
                                    "not_found",
                                    "method_not_allowed",
                                    "conflict",
                                    "payload_too_large",
                                    "unprocessable_entity",
                                    "rate_limited",
                                    "internal_error",
                                    "service_unavailable",
                                    "client_error",
                                    "server_error",
                                    "unknown_error",
                                    "insufficient_scope",
                                    "token_expired",
                                    "token_revoked",
                                    "token_invalid",
                                    "csrf_token_required",
                                    "csrf_token_invalid"
                                ]
                            },
                            "correlation_id": {
                                "type": "string",
                                "description": "16 lowercase hex characters.",
                                "example": "0f3a9c2b71de44c1"
                            },
                            "required_scope": {
                                "type": "string",
                                "nullable": true,
                                "description": "Present on a 403 from the scope gate."
                            },
                            "held_scopes": {
                                "type": "array",
                                "items": {
                                    "type": "string"
                                },
                                "description": "Present on a 403 from the scope gate."
                            },
                            "required_credits": {
                                "type": "number",
                                "description": "Present on a 402 insufficient_credits when the cost is known."
                            },
                            "available_credits": {
                                "type": "number",
                                "description": "Present on a 402 insufficient_credits when the balance is known."
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "timestamp": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "format": "date-time"
                    }
                }
            },
            "Error": {
                "description": "Deprecated alias for ErrorEnvelope. Identical shape; use ErrorEnvelope.",
                "allOf": [
                    {
                        "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "ModelList": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                    "success": {
                        "type": "boolean",
                        "example": true
                    },
                    "data": {
                        "type": "object",
                        "properties": {
                            "tools": {
                                "type": "array",
                                "description": "One entry per model-driven tool. Each lists the models and aspect ratios that tool accepts.",
                                "items": {
                                    "type": "object",
                                    "properties": {
                                        "id": {
                                            "type": "string",
                                            "description": "Tool identifier.",
                                            "example": "image-variator"
                                        },
                                        "endpoint": {
                                            "type": "string",
                                            "description": "The endpoint this tool maps to.",
                                            "example": "POST /api/v1/images/vary"
                                        },
                                        "input": {
                                            "type": "string",
                                            "description": "Summary of the required input.",
                                            "example": "file_uuid + prompt"
                                        },
                                        "models": {
                                            "type": "array",
                                            "items": {
                                                "type": "object",
                                                "properties": {
                                                    "id": {
                                                        "type": "string",
                                                        "description": "Value to pass as `model`.",
                                                        "example": "pro"
                                                    },
                                                    "name": {
                                                        "type": "string",
                                                        "example": "Nano Banana Pro"
                                                    },
                                                    "description": {
                                                        "type": "string"
                                                    },
                                                    "default": {
                                                        "type": "boolean",
                                                        "description": "True for the model used when `model` is omitted."
                                                    },
                                                    "options": {
                                                        "type": "object",
                                                        "description": "Supported entries for the request `options` object, keyed by option name. Each has `param` plus `values`+`default` (enum) or `min`+`max`+`default` (range).",
                                                        "additionalProperties": true
                                                    },
                                                    "fields": {
                                                        "type": "object",
                                                        "description": "Top-level request fields whose values depend on this model, keyed by field name (for video models: `resolution` and `duration`, sent beside `prompt`, not inside `options`). Same entry shape as `options`.",
                                                        "additionalProperties": true
                                                    }
                                                }
                                            }
                                        },
                                        "aspect_ratios": {
                                            "type": "array",
                                            "items": {
                                                "type": "string"
                                            },
                                            "example": [
                                                "1:1",
                                                "16:9",
                                                "9:16"
                                            ]
                                        }
                                    }
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "timestamp": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "format": "date-time"
                    }
                }
            },
            "GalleryItem": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                    "uuid": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "format": "uuid",
                        "description": "The FILE uuid. Use it with GET /v1/gallery/{uuid}, GET /v1/files/{uuid}/download and the other /v1/files routes. It was the GENERATION uuid before Phase 14 - see x-breaking-changes."
                    },
                    "generation_uuid": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "format": "uuid",
                        "nullable": true,
                        "description": "The generation that produced this item. This is what `uuid` used to carry."
                    },
                    "type": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "description": "Specific generation type, e.g. image_generation, video_generation, caption_generation."
                    },
                    "category": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "enum": [
                            "images",
                            "videos",
                            "audio",
                            "text",
                            "files"
                        ],
                        "description": "The scope container this item belongs to. Same vocabulary as the read scopes (`images:read` reads `images`). Was singular (`image`/`video`) before Phase 14 - see x-breaking-changes."
                    },
                    "container": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "enum": [
                            "images",
                            "videos",
                            "audio",
                            "text",
                            "files"
                        ],
                        "description": "Identical value to `category`, named in the scope vocabulary. `category` is the field existing consumers read; `container` is the explicit synonym."
                    },
                    "status": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "enum": [
                            "completed",
                            "generating",
                            "failed"
                        ]
                    },
                    "title": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "nullable": true
                    },
                    "created_at": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "format": "date-time"
                    },
                    "completed_at": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "format": "date-time",
                        "nullable": true
                    },
                    "credits_used": {
                        "type": "number",
                        "nullable": true
                    },
                    "file": {
                        "type": "object",
                        "nullable": true,
                        "description": "Present for completed file-backed items (images/videos). null otherwise.",
                        "properties": {
                            "uuid": {
                                "type": "string"
                            },
                            "download_url": {
                                "type": "string",
                                "description": "Authenticated download path; accepts the same Bearer token."
                            },
                            "mime_type": {
                                "type": "string",
                                "nullable": true
                            },
                            "size_bytes": {
                                "type": "integer",
                                "nullable": true
                            },
                            "kind": {
                                "type": "string",
                                "nullable": true,
                                "description": "image|video|document|\u2026"
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "text": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "nullable": true,
                        "description": "Text output for text generations (captions, transcripts, etc.)."
                    }
                }
            },
            "JobQueued": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                    "success": {
                        "type": "boolean",
                        "example": true
                    },
                    "data": {
                        "type": "object",
                        "properties": {
                            "job_id": {
                                "type": "integer"
                            },
                            "generation_id": {
                                "type": "integer"
                            },
                            "generation_uuid": {
                                "type": "string",
                                "format": "uuid"
                            },
                            "status": {
                                "type": "string",
                                "example": "pending"
                            },
                            "estimated_credits": {
                                "type": "number",
                                "format": "float"
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "timestamp": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "format": "date-time"
                    }
                }
            },
            "JobStatus": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                    "success": {
                        "type": "boolean",
                        "example": true
                    },
                    "data": {
                        "type": "object",
                        "properties": {
                            "job_id": {
                                "type": "integer"
                            },
                            "generation_id": {
                                "type": "integer"
                            },
                            "status": {
                                "type": "string",
                                "enum": [
                                    "pending",
                                    "processing",
                                    "completed",
                                    "failed",
                                    "cancelled"
                                ]
                            },
                            "created_at": {
                                "type": "string",
                                "format": "date-time",
                                "nullable": true
                            },
                            "started_at": {
                                "type": "string",
                                "format": "date-time",
                                "nullable": true
                            },
                            "completed_at": {
                                "type": "string",
                                "format": "date-time",
                                "nullable": true
                            },
                            "attempts": {
                                "type": "integer"
                            },
                            "credits_used": {
                                "type": "number",
                                "format": "float"
                            },
                            "result": {
                                "type": "object",
                                "nullable": true,
                                "properties": {
                                    "file_uuid": {
                                        "type": "string",
                                        "format": "uuid",
                                        "nullable": true
                                    },
                                    "download_url": {
                                        "type": "string",
                                        "nullable": true
                                    },
                                    "credits_used": {
                                        "type": "number",
                                        "format": "float"
                                    }
                                }
                            },
                            "error": {
                                "type": "string",
                                "nullable": true
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "timestamp": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "format": "date-time"
                    }
                }
            },
            "UpscaleQueued": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                    "success": {
                        "type": "boolean",
                        "example": true
                    },
                    "data": {
                        "type": "object",
                        "properties": {
                            "krea_job_id": {
                                "type": "string"
                            },
                            "generation_id": {
                                "type": "integer"
                            },
                            "status": {
                                "type": "string",
                                "example": "processing"
                            },
                            "estimated_credits": {
                                "type": "number",
                                "format": "float"
                            },
                            "src_width": {
                                "type": "integer"
                            },
                            "src_height": {
                                "type": "integer"
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "timestamp": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "format": "date-time"
                    }
                }
            },
            "UpscaleStatus": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                    "success": {
                        "type": "boolean",
                        "example": true
                    },
                    "data": {
                        "type": "object",
                        "properties": {
                            "status": {
                                "type": "string",
                                "enum": [
                                    "processing",
                                    "completed",
                                    "failed"
                                ]
                            },
                            "file_uuid": {
                                "type": "string",
                                "format": "uuid",
                                "nullable": true
                            },
                            "download_url": {
                                "type": "string",
                                "nullable": true
                            },
                            "credits_used": {
                                "type": "number",
                                "format": "float",
                                "nullable": true
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "timestamp": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "format": "date-time"
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    },
    "paths": {
        "/v1/openapi.json": {
            "get": {
                "summary": "OpenAPI specification",
                "description": "Returns this OpenAPI spec. No authentication required.",
                "operationId": "getOpenApiSpec",
                "security": [],
                "tags": [
                    "Meta"
                ],
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "OpenAPI 3.1 JSON document"
                    },
                    "default": {
                        "description": "Any other error. Every failure this API emits uses the same envelope; branch on `error.type`, never on `error.message`, and quote `error.correlation_id` to support.",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                },
                "x-required-scope": null,
                "x-public": true
            }
        },
        "/v1/models": {
            "get": {
                "summary": "List available models",
                "description": "Lists the image and video models each generation tool accepts for the `model` field,\nwith each model's supported `options`, its model-dependent top-level `fields`\n(a video model's `resolution` and `duration`) and the available `aspect_ratios`.\nNo authentication required - use this to discover valid values before calling\n`POST /v1/images/generate`, `/v1/images/vary`, `/v1/images/fuse` or `/v1/videos/generate`.",
                "operationId": "listModels",
                "security": [],
                "tags": [
                    "Meta"
                ],
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "Available models and options",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ModelList"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "default": {
                        "description": "Any other error. Every failure this API emits uses the same envelope; branch on `error.type`, never on `error.message`, and quote `error.correlation_id` to support.",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                },
                "x-required-scope": null,
                "x-public": true
            }
        },
        "/v1/gallery": {
            "get": {
                "summary": "List your generations",
                "description": "Lists everything you have created - images, videos, audio and text - newest first.\nEach completed file-backed item includes a `file.download_url` you can fetch with the same Bearer token.\nText generations (captions, transcripts, etc.) include a `text` field.\n\nItems are filtered to the containers your token can read. A token holding no\nreadable container gets an empty list with a 200, never a 403: the route gate\nalready ran and this is a view filter, not an access denial.\n\nBREAKING CHANGES that landed on this response - see `x-breaking-changes`:\n`item.uuid` is now the FILE uuid (the generation uuid moved to `generation_uuid`),\nand `item.category` now reports the plural container vocabulary\n(images|videos|audio|text|files) where it used to report image|video|text|other.",
                "operationId": "listGallery",
                "tags": [
                    "Gallery"
                ],
                "parameters": [
                    {
                        "name": "category",
                        "in": "query",
                        "required": false,
                        "schema": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "enum": [
                                "all",
                                "images",
                                "videos",
                                "audio",
                                "text",
                                "files",
                                "image",
                                "video"
                            ],
                            "default": "all"
                        },
                        "description": "Filter by scope container. This is the SAME vocabulary every item's `category` and `container` field reports, so a value read out of a payload can be filtered on. DEPRECATED and accepted for one more release: the singular image and video; a request using either is answered with a `Deprecation: true` response header. Anything else is a 400 whose message lists the valid values."
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "status",
                        "in": "query",
                        "required": false,
                        "schema": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "enum": [
                                "completed"
                            ]
                        },
                        "description": "Only `completed` is accepted; omit for all. `generating` and `failed` are 400s, not empty pages."
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "limit",
                        "in": "query",
                        "required": false,
                        "schema": {
                            "type": "integer",
                            "minimum": 1,
                            "maximum": 100,
                            "default": 25
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "offset",
                        "in": "query",
                        "required": false,
                        "schema": {
                            "type": "integer",
                            "minimum": 0,
                            "default": 0
                        }
                    }
                ],
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "A page of gallery items",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "type": "object",
                                    "properties": {
                                        "success": {
                                            "type": "boolean",
                                            "example": true
                                        },
                                        "data": {
                                            "type": "object",
                                            "properties": {
                                                "items": {
                                                    "type": "array",
                                                    "items": {
                                                        "$ref": "#/components/schemas/GalleryItem"
                                                    }
                                                },
                                                "pagination": {
                                                    "type": "object",
                                                    "properties": {
                                                        "total": {
                                                            "type": "integer"
                                                        },
                                                        "limit": {
                                                            "type": "integer"
                                                        },
                                                        "offset": {
                                                            "type": "integer"
                                                        },
                                                        "has_more": {
                                                            "type": "boolean"
                                                        }
                                                    }
                                                }
                                            }
                                        }
                                    }
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "400": {
                        "description": "An unknown `category`, or a `status` other than `completed`. The message lists the valid values.",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "401": {
                        "description": "Missing or invalid API key.",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "403": {
                        "description": "The token holds neither images:read nor videos:read.",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "default": {
                        "description": "Any other error. Every failure this API emits uses the same envelope; branch on `error.type`, never on `error.message`, and quote `error.correlation_id` to support.",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                },
                "x-required-scope": [
                    "images:read",
                    "videos:read"
                ]
            }
        },
        "/v1/gallery/browse": {
            "get": {
                "summary": "Browse one page of your images and videos with short-lived links",
                "description": "The paged, link-carrying form of `GET /v1/gallery`, built for viewers such as the MCP\n`show_gallery` tool. This call is free: no credits are charged, no model is called and\nno bytes are returned. Every item carries presigned URLs that expire after 15 minutes.\n\n- `thumbnail_url` opens a small stored thumbnail (or, for a video, its poster) inline.\n- `view_url` opens the original image, or plays the video, inline; `download_url` saves it.\n- **Every URL is a credential for 15 minutes**: anyone holding it can read the file. Do\n  not log it or pass it on.\n- An item stored only on the server disk, or one that cannot be presigned right now, is\n  still listed, with its link fields `null`, so page sizes and offsets stay stable.\n\nThe `category` is intersected with the containers your token can read: a token holding\nonly `images:read` never sees videos, whatever it asks for. A literal path, so it is never\nread as `GET /v1/gallery/{uuid}`.",
                "operationId": "galleryBrowse",
                "tags": [
                    "Gallery"
                ],
                "parameters": [
                    {
                        "name": "category",
                        "in": "query",
                        "required": false,
                        "schema": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "enum": [
                                "images",
                                "videos",
                                "all"
                            ],
                            "default": "all"
                        },
                        "description": "Anything else, including the singular forms, is a 400."
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "limit",
                        "in": "query",
                        "required": false,
                        "schema": {
                            "type": "integer",
                            "minimum": 1,
                            "maximum": 24,
                            "default": 12
                        },
                        "description": "Items per page. A non-integer is a 400."
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "offset",
                        "in": "query",
                        "required": false,
                        "schema": {
                            "type": "integer",
                            "minimum": 0,
                            "default": 0
                        },
                        "description": "Items to skip. A negative or non-integer value is a 400."
                    }
                ],
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "One page of items with 15-minute links.",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "type": "object",
                                    "properties": {
                                        "success": {
                                            "type": "boolean",
                                            "example": true
                                        },
                                        "data": {
                                            "type": "object",
                                            "properties": {
                                                "items": {
                                                    "type": "array",
                                                    "items": {
                                                        "type": "object",
                                                        "properties": {
                                                            "uuid": {
                                                                "type": "string",
                                                                "format": "uuid"
                                                            },
                                                            "kind": {
                                                                "type": "string",
                                                                "enum": [
                                                                    "image",
                                                                    "video"
                                                                ]
                                                            },
                                                            "file_name": {
                                                                "type": "string"
                                                            },
                                                            "mime_type": {
                                                                "type": "string",
                                                                "nullable": true
                                                            },
                                                            "width": {
                                                                "type": "integer",
                                                                "nullable": true
                                                            },
                                                            "height": {
                                                                "type": "integer",
                                                                "nullable": true
                                                            },
                                                            "created_at": {
                                                                "type": "string",
                                                                "format": "date-time",
                                                                "nullable": true
                                                            },
                                                            "title": {
                                                                "type": "string",
                                                                "nullable": true
                                                            },
                                                            "thumbnail_url": {
                                                                "type": "string",
                                                                "nullable": true,
                                                                "description": "Presigned inline URL for a small version or video poster. A credential."
                                                            },
                                                            "view_url": {
                                                                "type": "string",
                                                                "nullable": true,
                                                                "description": "Presigned inline URL for the original image or video. A credential."
                                                            },
                                                            "download_url": {
                                                                "type": "string",
                                                                "nullable": true,
                                                                "description": "Presigned download URL for the original. A credential."
                                                            }
                                                        }
                                                    }
                                                },
                                                "pagination": {
                                                    "type": "object",
                                                    "properties": {
                                                        "total": {
                                                            "type": "integer"
                                                        },
                                                        "limit": {
                                                            "type": "integer"
                                                        },
                                                        "offset": {
                                                            "type": "integer"
                                                        },
                                                        "has_more": {
                                                            "type": "boolean"
                                                        }
                                                    }
                                                },
                                                "category": {
                                                    "type": "string",
                                                    "enum": [
                                                        "images",
                                                        "videos",
                                                        "all"
                                                    ]
                                                },
                                                "expires_at": {
                                                    "type": "string",
                                                    "format": "date-time"
                                                },
                                                "expires_in_seconds": {
                                                    "type": "integer"
                                                }
                                            }
                                        },
                                        "timestamp": {
                                            "type": "string",
                                            "format": "date-time"
                                        }
                                    }
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "400": {
                        "description": "Invalid `category`, `limit` or `offset`.",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "401": {
                        "description": "Missing or invalid API key.",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "403": {
                        "description": "The token holds neither images:read nor videos:read.",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "default": {
                        "description": "Any other error. Every failure this API emits uses the same envelope; branch on `error.type`, never on `error.message`, and quote `error.correlation_id` to support.",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                },
                "x-required-scope": [
                    "images:read",
                    "videos:read"
                ]
            }
        },
        "/v1/gallery/{uuid}": {
            "get": {
                "summary": "Get one generation",
                "description": "Returns a single item you own, including its full `input_data`/`output_data` and a download-ready `file` when available. NOTE the path parameter is the FILE uuid, which is what the list response returns as `uuid` - the generation uuid is a different value and is returned as `generation_uuid`. See `x-breaking-changes`.",
                "operationId": "getGalleryItem",
                "tags": [
                    "Gallery"
                ],
                "parameters": [
                    {
                        "name": "uuid",
                        "in": "path",
                        "required": true,
                        "schema": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "format": "uuid"
                        },
                        "description": "The FILE uuid, which is what the gallery list returns as `uuid`; not the generation uuid."
                    }
                ],
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "The generation",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "type": "object",
                                    "properties": {
                                        "success": {
                                            "type": "boolean",
                                            "example": true
                                        },
                                        "data": {
                                            "allOf": [
                                                {
                                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/GalleryItem"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "type": "object",
                                                    "properties": {
                                                        "input_data": {
                                                            "type": "object",
                                                            "description": "The original request payload."
                                                        },
                                                        "output_data": {
                                                            "type": "object",
                                                            "description": "The result payload, with internal error/diagnostic fields redacted."
                                                        },
                                                        "error": {
                                                            "type": "boolean",
                                                            "description": "Present and true when the generation failed (status=failed). Internal error detail is not exposed."
                                                        }
                                                    }
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        }
                                    }
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "401": {
                        "description": "Missing or invalid API key",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "404": {
                        "description": "Not found or not owned by you",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "default": {
                        "description": "Any other error. Every failure this API emits uses the same envelope; branch on `error.type`, never on `error.message`, and quote `error.correlation_id` to support.",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                },
                "x-required-scope": [
                    "images:read",
                    "videos:read"
                ]
            }
        },
        "/v1/files/upload": {
            "post": {
                "summary": "Upload a source file",
                "description": "Upload a file into your library and receive a `file_uuid`. This is the single\ningest route for the whole API: pass the uuid to the image endpoints\n(`/v1/images/vary`, `/fuse`, `/upscale`, `/remove-background`, `/describe`,\n`/instagram-enhance`), as a video start frame, to `/v1/audio/transcribe`, or to\n`/v1/videos/merge`.\n\nACCEPTED TYPES (this list is read from the server's own allowlist, not restated):\n`image/png`, `image/jpeg`, `image/webp`, `image/gif`, `audio/mpeg`, `audio/wav`, `video/mp4`.\nThe type is SNIFFED from the bytes; the filename extension is not trusted.\n\nSIZE LIMITS, and they are MEASURED against the deployed server rather than copied\nfrom a constant:\n- images: 25 MB\n- audio and video: 48 MB\n\nThe 48 MB figure is deliberately below the gateway request-body limit of 50 MB,\nwhich was measured byte-for-byte on the deployed stack: a 52,428,800-byte request\nbody was accepted and 52,428,801 bytes was cut off mid-upload with an HTML error\npage. The margin exists so that an oversized upload gets THIS API's JSON 413 with a\nusable message instead of the gateway's HTML. Note the gateway limit applies to the\nwhole multipart REQUEST BODY - the file plus framing plus the filename - not to the\nfile alone. A body past that limit does not produce a JSON error at all.\n\n`width` and `height` are returned for images and are null for audio and video.\nThe response shape is otherwise unchanged from when this route was images-only.",
                "operationId": "uploadFile",
                "tags": [
                    "Files"
                ],
                "requestBody": {
                    "required": true,
                    "content": {
                        "multipart/form-data": {
                            "schema": {
                                "type": "object",
                                "required": [
                                    "file"
                                ],
                                "properties": {
                                    "file": {
                                        "type": "string",
                                        "format": "binary",
                                        "description": "The file to upload. Type is sniffed from the bytes."
                                    }
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                },
                "responses": {
                    "201": {
                        "description": "Stored",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "type": "object",
                                    "properties": {
                                        "success": {
                                            "type": "boolean",
                                            "example": true
                                        },
                                        "data": {
                                            "type": "object",
                                            "properties": {
                                                "file_uuid": {
                                                    "type": "string",
                                                    "description": "Pass this as file_uuid to the image endpoints."
                                                },
                                                "mime_type": {
                                                    "type": "string"
                                                },
                                                "size_bytes": {
                                                    "type": "integer"
                                                },
                                                "width": {
                                                    "type": "integer",
                                                    "nullable": true,
                                                    "description": "Images only; null for audio and video."
                                                },
                                                "height": {
                                                    "type": "integer",
                                                    "nullable": true,
                                                    "description": "Images only; null for audio and video."
                                                }
                                            }
                                        }
                                    }
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "400": {
                        "description": "No file field, or a file the server could not read.",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "401": {
                        "description": "Missing or invalid API key.",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "413": {
                        "description": "Too large: over 25 MB for an image, or over 48 MB for audio/video. A request BODY over the 50 MB gateway limit is cut off before this handler runs and returns an HTML page instead.",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "415": {
                        "description": "Unsupported type. The message lists the accepted mime types.",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "default": {
                        "description": "Any other error. Every failure this API emits uses the same envelope; branch on `error.type`, never on `error.message`, and quote `error.correlation_id` to support.",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                },
                "x-required-scope": "files:write"
            }
        },
        "/v1/images/generate": {
            "post": {
                "summary": "Generate an image (async)",
                "description": "Queue a text-to-image generation job.\nReturns immediately with a `job_id`.\nPoll `GET /v1/jobs/{id}` until `status` is `completed`, then use `download_url`.",
                "operationId": "generateImage",
                "tags": [
                    "Images"
                ],
                "requestBody": {
                    "required": true,
                    "content": {
                        "application/json": {
                            "schema": {
                                "type": "object",
                                "required": [
                                    "prompt"
                                ],
                                "properties": {
                                    "prompt": {
                                        "type": "string",
                                        "description": "Text description of the image to generate.",
                                        "example": "A serene mountain lake at golden hour, photorealistic"
                                    },
                                    "model": {
                                        "type": "string",
                                        "description": "Model to use for generation. Discover the full list with options via GET /v1/models.",
                                        "enum": [
                                            "standard",
                                            "lite",
                                            "pro",
                                            "flux",
                                            "seedream",
                                            "seedream5",
                                            "gpt-image-2.5-flare"
                                        ],
                                        "default": "standard"
                                    },
                                    "aspect_ratio": {
                                        "type": "string",
                                        "description": "Aspect ratio of the generated image.",
                                        "enum": [
                                            "1:1",
                                            "16:9",
                                            "9:16",
                                            "4:3",
                                            "3:4",
                                            "3:2",
                                            "2:3"
                                        ],
                                        "default": "1:1"
                                    },
                                    "options": {
                                        "type": "object",
                                        "description": "Model-specific options.",
                                        "properties": {
                                            "seed": {
                                                "type": "integer",
                                                "description": "Seed for reproducible results."
                                            },
                                            "temperature": {
                                                "type": "number",
                                                "format": "float",
                                                "description": "Creativity (0.0\u20132.0). Lower = closer to prompt. Ignored by the Gemini models, which no longer accept it.",
                                                "default": 1
                                            },
                                            "resolution": {
                                                "type": "string",
                                                "enum": [
                                                    "1024",
                                                    "2048",
                                                    "4096"
                                                ],
                                                "description": "Output resolution (pro model only).",
                                                "default": "2048"
                                            }
                                        }
                                    }
                                }
                            },
                            "examples": {
                                "standard": {
                                    "summary": "Standard model",
                                    "value": {
                                        "prompt": "A futuristic city skyline at night",
                                        "model": "standard",
                                        "aspect_ratio": "16:9"
                                    }
                                },
                                "flux": {
                                    "summary": "Flux with seed",
                                    "value": {
                                        "prompt": "Portrait of a red fox in autumn forest",
                                        "model": "flux",
                                        "aspect_ratio": "1:1",
                                        "options": {
                                            "seed": 42,
                                            "temperature": 0.7
                                        }
                                    }
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                },
                "responses": {
                    "202": {
                        "description": "Job queued",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/JobQueued"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "401": {
                        "description": "Missing or invalid API key",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "402": {
                        "description": "Insufficient credits",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "422": {
                        "description": "Validation error",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "default": {
                        "description": "Any other error. Every failure this API emits uses the same envelope; branch on `error.type`, never on `error.message`, and quote `error.correlation_id` to support.",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                },
                "x-required-scope": "images:write"
            }
        },
        "/v1/images/vary": {
            "post": {
                "summary": "Create an image variation (async, image-to-image)",
                "description": "Generate a new image based on one already in your library, guided by a prompt.\nGet a `file_uuid` first via POST /v1/files/upload, then pass it here.\nReturns immediately with a `job_id` - poll `GET /v1/jobs/{id}` until\n`status` is `completed`, then use `download_url`.\nDiscover valid `model` values via GET /v1/models.",
                "operationId": "varyImage",
                "tags": [
                    "Images"
                ],
                "requestBody": {
                    "required": true,
                    "content": {
                        "application/json": {
                            "schema": {
                                "type": "object",
                                "required": [
                                    "file_uuid",
                                    "prompt"
                                ],
                                "properties": {
                                    "file_uuid": {
                                        "type": "string",
                                        "description": "UUID of a source image already in your library.",
                                        "example": "3f2504e0-4f89-41d3-9a0c-0305e82c3301"
                                    },
                                    "prompt": {
                                        "type": "string",
                                        "description": "How the variation should differ from the source.",
                                        "example": "Same composition, but at sunset with warm golden light"
                                    },
                                    "model": {
                                        "type": "string",
                                        "description": "Model to use for the variation.",
                                        "enum": [
                                            "standard",
                                            "lite",
                                            "pro",
                                            "flux",
                                            "seedream",
                                            "seedream5"
                                        ],
                                        "default": "standard"
                                    },
                                    "aspect_ratio": {
                                        "type": "string",
                                        "description": "Output aspect ratio. Omit to keep the source ratio.",
                                        "enum": [
                                            "1:1",
                                            "16:9",
                                            "9:16",
                                            "4:3",
                                            "3:4",
                                            "3:2",
                                            "2:3"
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    "variability": {
                                        "type": "integer",
                                        "description": "How far the result may stray from the source (1 = subtle, 5 = experimental).",
                                        "minimum": 1,
                                        "maximum": 5,
                                        "default": 1
                                    },
                                    "options": {
                                        "type": "object",
                                        "description": "Model-specific options.",
                                        "properties": {
                                            "resolution": {
                                                "type": "string",
                                                "enum": [
                                                    "1024",
                                                    "2048",
                                                    "4096"
                                                ],
                                                "description": "Output resolution (pro model only).",
                                                "default": "2048"
                                            }
                                        }
                                    }
                                }
                            },
                            "examples": {
                                "subtle": {
                                    "summary": "Subtle restyle",
                                    "value": {
                                        "file_uuid": "3f2504e0-4f89-41d3-9a0c-0305e82c3301",
                                        "prompt": "Same scene at sunset, warm light",
                                        "model": "standard",
                                        "variability": 2
                                    }
                                },
                                "experimental": {
                                    "summary": "Bold variation with Flux",
                                    "value": {
                                        "file_uuid": "3f2504e0-4f89-41d3-9a0c-0305e82c3301",
                                        "prompt": "Reimagine as a watercolor painting",
                                        "model": "flux",
                                        "aspect_ratio": "1:1",
                                        "variability": 5
                                    }
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                },
                "responses": {
                    "202": {
                        "description": "Job queued",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/JobQueued"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "400": {
                        "description": "Missing file_uuid or prompt",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "401": {
                        "description": "Missing or invalid API key",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "402": {
                        "description": "Insufficient credits",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "403": {
                        "description": "File belongs to another user",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "404": {
                        "description": "Source file not found",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "default": {
                        "description": "Any other error. Every failure this API emits uses the same envelope; branch on `error.type`, never on `error.message`, and quote `error.correlation_id` to support.",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                },
                "x-required-scope": "images:write"
            }
        },
        "/v1/images/fuse": {
            "post": {
                "summary": "Fuse multiple images (async, image-to-image)",
                "description": "Combine 2\u201310 images from your library into a single cohesive image, guided by an optional prompt.\nReturns immediately with a `job_id` - poll `GET /v1/jobs/{id}` until `status` is `completed`.\nDiscover valid `model` values via GET /v1/models (same set as variation).",
                "operationId": "fuseImages",
                "tags": [
                    "Images"
                ],
                "requestBody": {
                    "required": true,
                    "content": {
                        "application/json": {
                            "schema": {
                                "type": "object",
                                "required": [
                                    "file_uuids"
                                ],
                                "properties": {
                                    "file_uuids": {
                                        "type": "array",
                                        "items": {
                                            "type": "string"
                                        },
                                        "minItems": 2,
                                        "maxItems": 10,
                                        "description": "UUIDs of 2\u201310 source images already in your library."
                                    },
                                    "prompt": {
                                        "type": "string",
                                        "description": "Optional direction for how the images should be combined.",
                                        "example": "Place the character from the first image into the landscape of the second"
                                    },
                                    "model": {
                                        "type": "string",
                                        "description": "Model to use for the fusion.",
                                        "enum": [
                                            "standard",
                                            "lite",
                                            "pro",
                                            "flux",
                                            "seedream",
                                            "seedream5"
                                        ],
                                        "default": "standard"
                                    },
                                    "aspect_ratio": {
                                        "type": "string",
                                        "description": "Aspect ratio of the result.",
                                        "enum": [
                                            "1:1",
                                            "16:9",
                                            "9:16",
                                            "4:3",
                                            "3:4",
                                            "3:2",
                                            "2:3"
                                        ],
                                        "default": "1:1"
                                    },
                                    "options": {
                                        "type": "object",
                                        "description": "Model-specific options.",
                                        "properties": {
                                            "resolution": {
                                                "type": "string",
                                                "enum": [
                                                    "1024",
                                                    "2048",
                                                    "4096"
                                                ],
                                                "description": "Output resolution (pro model only).",
                                                "default": "2048"
                                            }
                                        }
                                    }
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                },
                "responses": {
                    "202": {
                        "description": "Job queued",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/JobQueued"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "400": {
                        "description": "Fewer than 2 or more than 10 file_uuids",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "401": {
                        "description": "Missing or invalid API key",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "402": {
                        "description": "Insufficient credits",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "403": {
                        "description": "A file belongs to another user",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "404": {
                        "description": "A source file was not found",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "default": {
                        "description": "Any other error. Every failure this API emits uses the same envelope; branch on `error.type`, never on `error.message`, and quote `error.correlation_id` to support.",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                },
                "x-required-scope": "images:write"
            }
        },
        "/v1/images/describe": {
            "post": {
                "summary": "Describe / caption an image (sync)",
                "description": "Generate a natural-language description or caption (e.g. alt text) for an image in your library.\nSynchronous - the description is returned directly in the response.",
                "operationId": "describeImage",
                "tags": [
                    "Images"
                ],
                "requestBody": {
                    "required": true,
                    "content": {
                        "application/json": {
                            "schema": {
                                "type": "object",
                                "required": [
                                    "file_uuid"
                                ],
                                "properties": {
